0015DAr 2               ; 16-byte header: cell width, source height, row stride, seven byte extents.
0015DAr 2               ; Each row: raw foreground pattern, then two 4-bit pair statuses/byte.
0015DAr 2               ; Fine art keeps opacity/foreground per source dot. Both $A and $F use the
0015DAr 2               ; row material. Adapted hair/legs use $0/$5/$F for empty/black/full-color cells.
